  "category": "mixer",
  "summary": "A 24-channel digital mixing console with motorised faders, onboard processing, and a 32x32 USB audio interface. The full desk carries 24 mono mic/line inputs and three stereo inputs; this entry sketches the first four mic channels and models the routing and interface connections in full. Drawn as a desk: the control surface is the top, the sockets are on the rear, and the front is the lip below the faders. The fader bank is drawn as the shape of the device rather than as controls - the entry describes four of its twenty-four channels, and twenty-five movable faders would claim a fidelity it does not have.",
